	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>In <persName ref="p3988">Wolphium</persName> illum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p3988">Johannes Wolf</persName>, zu diesem Zeitpunkt Pfarrer an der Predigerkirche in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note>, candidissimum iuvenem ac valde, ut videtur, doctum, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>valde dolet quod nihil officiorum collocare potuimus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Abfuit domo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p4321">uxor</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="2"><persName ref="p4321">Katharina, geb. Ryff</persName>.</note>, quę heri primum <placeName ref="l26">Balingeno</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><placeName ref="l26">Balingen</placeName> (<placeName ref="l3586">Lkr. Tübingen</placeName>, <placeName ref="l572">Baden-Württemberg</placeName>).</note> reversa est, ut convivam, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>valde sordide tractare voluissem, mensę nostrę adhibere haud potuerim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Utinam sit aliquando aliunde, quo compensare malignitatem istam liceat!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Quod meas magno desiderio expectas, quibus diserte tibi, quid <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l157">Francofordię</placeName> actum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Der <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldische</placeName> Bundestag in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName>; s. zuletzt <ref target="file12401">Nr. 2354</ref>,1-4.</note> sit, significem, ego longe maiore desiderio <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>istuc a <persName ref="p8178">fratre</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note>, ut diligenter mihi narret, flagito, et recepit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ille nuper se ad te capita quędam totius negocii scripturum;<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName> schrieb am 18. März an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> (<ref target="file12431">Nr. 2384</ref>).</note> id, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod ut faciat, identidem ipsi aurem vellico<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 1, 7, 40 <hi>(ASD</hi> II/2 166f. <ref target="file10678">Nr. 640</ref>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Puto autem te pro<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>pediem illa ab ipsomet accepturum.<pb type="edition" next="201"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>A <persName ref="p8472">Curione</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8472">Konrad Hofherr</persName>.</note> per dominum te obsecro, ut pecuniam, quemadmodum <persName ref="p8171">Theodorus</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> noster <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>monuit, accipias<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">In einem Brief an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> vom 27. Februar 1546 <hi>(<persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW</hi> II 419, <ref target="file11298">Nr. 1255</ref>) hatte <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> geraten, wegen <persName ref="p8472">Hofherrs</persName> verschwenderischen Umgangs mit Geld die Aufsicht über dessen Finanzen lieber an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> zu übergeben; s. auch <ref target="file12401">Nr. 2354</ref>,28-35; <ref target="file12413">Nr. 2366</ref>,13f. Auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Wunsch hin verwaltete <persName ref="p8171">Bibliander</persName> aber auch weiterhin <persName ref="p8472">Hofherrs</persName> Geld (<ref target="file12423">Nr. 2376</ref>,28-39), wie aus <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> vom 22. März <hi>(<persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW</hi> II 429, <ref target="file11310">Nr. 1267</ref>) hervorgeht.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Omnino enim nolo, ut sibi ipse sit tanta incuria <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName ref="p8472">Curio</persName> et tutor; sed scribam de hoc proximo nuncio et ipsi <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Ein solcher Brief <persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> findet sich nicht in <hi><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW.</hi> Er wurde am 13. März verfasst und dem Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 15. März beigelegt (<ref target="file12428">Nr. 2381</ref>,25f). <persName ref="p8171">Biblianders</persName> Antwort darauf ist erhalten <hi>(<persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW</hi> II 429, <ref target="file11310">Nr. 1267</ref>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Multum enim refert, ut rationes ipsius ad debitos calculos revocari <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>possint apud <persName ref="p1410">Herbrotum</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p1410">Jakob Herbrot</persName>; s. <ref target="file12401">Nr. 2354</ref>, Anm. 31.</note>, ne aliis quoque ipsius negligentia (dicam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>an profusio?)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern</hi> ergänzt.</note> officiat atque ita etiam in publica commoda peccemus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Liber tuus<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Schrift "De sacramentis"; s. <ref target="file12379">Nr. 2332</ref>, Anm. 29, und zuletzt <ref target="file12413">Nr. 2366</ref>,7f und Anm. 9.</note> propediem ad te redibit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tu securo animo illum expecta.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Quod <persName ref="p4828">Studlera</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p4828">Agathe Studler</persName>, die am 27. Februar 1546 in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> ertränkt worden war; s. <ref target="file12412">Nr. 2365</ref>, Anm. 6.</note> dignas se penas dedit easque adeo christiano animo <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>fide in Christum vicit, domini immensam misericordiam merito veneramur <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et exosculamur; qui, ubi abundavit delictum, superabundare voluit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>omnibus delictis maiorem suam charitatem et gratiam<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 5, 20</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="162"/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> constanter scribitur <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>mortuum esse <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName>,<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> war am 18. Februar verstorben. - Aus diesem Zeitraum gibt es keine Briefe aus <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> in <hi><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>colloquium <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonense</placeName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Das Zweite <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Religionsgespräch.</note> per concilium<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Das Konzil zu <placeName ref="l1107">Trient</placeName>.</note> esse sublatum et colloquente<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>s <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentum</placeName> vocatos et citatos ad audiendum concilii decretum<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Vgl. <ref target="file12401">Nr. 2354</ref>,16-23; <ref target="file12407">Nr. 2360</ref>,23f.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8354">Laetus</persName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Von</hi> <persName ref="p8354">Laetus</persName> <hi>bis</hi> datum, etc. <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName>.</note> paucis scribit<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Nicht in <hi><persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName> cum suis incolumem <placeName ref="l18">Augustanis</placeName> in sinum datum, etc<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="22"><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName> war mit seiner Familie am 28. Februar wieder in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> eingetroffen; s. <ref target="file12379">Nr. 2332</ref>, Anm. 19; <ref target="file12411">Nr. 2364</ref>,1.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3590">Hessus</persName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> scribit nostris de no<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>vis bellis, quae <persName ref="p18538">caesar</persName><note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> et alii serio et ab integro nunc meditentur<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Nicht ermittelt.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p7706">Granvela</persName><note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><persName ref="p7706">Nicolas de Perrenot, Herr von Granvelle</persName>.</note> ad quasdam lantgravii literas de hac re, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>hoc est caesaris conatibus, tanta ambiguitate <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>respondit,<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27">Siehe <bibl source="b474">PA</bibl> II 18, Nr. 1385. 1386.</note> ut nostris suboleat nescio quid monstri, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>quod adversarii nostri cum caesare alant<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 2, 4, 98 <hi>(ASD</hi> II/3 394, <ref target="file11441">Nr. 1398</ref>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Der <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>kaiser ist in etwas rüstung; maint man aller ding<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29">aller ding: zweifellos.</note>, er gedenck, den <lb xml:id="p2z12"/><persName ref="p8462">bischoff</persName><pb type="edition" next="202"/> von <placeName ref="l267">Cöln</placeName><note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" n="30"><persName ref="p8462">Hermann von Wied</persName>.</note> anzegreyffen.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Der <persName ref="p7706">Gravell</persName> hat dem <persName ref="p3590">Hesso</persName> gschriben, der kayser seye in kainer r<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>üstung wider die protestierenden,<note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31">Siehe schon Anm. 27.</note> <foreign xml:lang="la">quod mox suspitionem secum adfert.</foreign></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Man sech ouch wol an der colnischen handlung, wie er<note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32">Der Kaiser.</note> nit gyrig <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>sey;<note xml:id="fn33" type="footnote" n="33">Ironisch gemeint.</note> dann er hab allerlay versuch mitt dem <persName ref="p8462">bischoff</persName><note xml:id="fn34" type="footnote" n="34"><persName ref="p8462">Hermann von Wied</persName>. - Vgl. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 281,10-12. 445f, Anm. 24. 463,2f; 520f,19-27. 548f,16-21.</note>, das er abst<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>ande ab attentatis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Habe aber nichts mögen helfen.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">6. martii 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse verdeckt, aber noch erkennbar auf der Rückseite des Blattes, das als S. 162 nummeriert wurde, und das auf der leeren Rückseite des Blattes mit der Seitenzahl 161 aufgeklebt wurde:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>venerando suo <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>longeque charissimo fratri.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
